  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1469",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-11T02:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-11T02:21:16.351Z",
    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा माथिल्लो वायूमण्डलमा रहेको न्युनचापीय प्रणालीको प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "The upper-level low-pressure system is currently influencing the weather over Nepal.",
    "today_np": "कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ, बाँकी भू-भागमाआंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती, गण्डकी र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा  मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित हल्का वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। मधेश तथा कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित हल्का वर्षाको सम्भावना छ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are expected over the Himalayan region of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, while partly cloudy conditions are expected over the remaining regions. There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall with thunderstorm/lightning at a few places in the Himalayan region of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, and at one or two places in the Himalayan region of Lumbini, Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces. There is also a possibility of light rain with thunderstorm/lightning at one or two places in the Hilly region of Koshi, Bagmati, Gandaki and Lumbini Provinces. Similarly, light rain with thunderstorm/lightning is likely at one or two places in Madhesh Province and the Terai region of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशको हिमाली भू-भागका साथै कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने र बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका साथै कोशी र बागमती प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy conditions are expected over the Himalayan region of the country as well as the Hilly region of Koshi, Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces, while the weather will remain mainly fair over the remaining regions. There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall with thunderstorm/lightning at one or two places in the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Gandaki Province and the Himalayan region of Koshi and Bagmati Provinces. Fog/mist is likely at a few places in the Terai, valleys and river basins during the morning.",
    "special": ""
  },
